=== base ===
# Landscaping Contract

This Contract is made between Greenhithe Grounds Ltd (the "Contractor") and Burnside Business Park Ltd (the "Owner").

## 4. Maintenance
4.1 The Contractor shall mow all lawns fortnightly between April and October.
4.2 The Contractor shall clear leaves from all paths weekly in autumn.
4.3 The Contractor shall grit the car parks before forecast frost.
=== amendment ===
# Variation No. 1

This Variation is made on 4 October 2027 between Greenhithe Grounds Ltd (the "Contractor") and Burnside Business Park Ltd (the "Owner").

1. Clauses 4.2 and 4.3 are renumbered as clauses 4.3 and 4.4 respectively.
2. Clause 4.4 (as renumbered) is deleted.
